    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1954582281248530442",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1954582281248530442",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1954582281248530442",
      "text": "[5:28PM] #IjuIshaga #TrafficUpdate \n\nFagba Intersection remains clear, with movement in and out of Amala Junction towards Jonathan Coker in good condition. The stretch along Iju Road down to Agege Pen Cinema is experiencing fast movement, and the return trip towards College is equally smooth.\n\nTraffic from Hospital Road to African Church School Junction is moving well, while Idi Agbon, Orimolade, Haruna, and the stretch to Yaya Abatan Junction are all good. Ajayi Road, both inward and outward Excellence Hotel Roundabout, is moving as expected, with a fast flow from there back to Jungle.\n\nMovement from Jungle to Fagba Intersection is swift, as is traffic inward Ishaga Roundabout, although Toyin is slightly busy at that end. The return journey from Ishaga to Fagba is also fast at the moment.\n\nNo impediments have been observed along the route, and our men are actively present and working to ensure ease of movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
