      "text": "[6:19PM] #Marina #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from UBA roundabout and NNPC filling station onward Cathedral Church down to Nitel intersection. \n\nMovement from State House inward McWen Bridge connecting Force Road is looking good.\n\nTraffic is moving perfectly from Zone 2 underneath bridge towards Flag Staff House inward McWen Bridge.\n\nGood movement from Onikan roundabout by TBS to Water Board down to Nitel intersection.\n\nGood on the entire stretch of Broad Street and Igbosere road.\n\nMovement from Catholic mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street is good.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
